        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせると　素早さが　さがるが\nふつうよりも　ポケモンの　攻撃が\n高く　育ちやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然携带后速度会降低，\n但宝可梦的攻击\n会比平时成长得更高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Potencia el Ataque de base, pero reduce la Velocidad\nen combate. Debe llevarlo un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
